# Editors and tooling
# Ignore the CONTENTS of .vscode/ (not the directory itself, or the negation
# below could not take effect), then keep the one shared file: the editor tasks
# are part of the course, while settings.json etc. are personal.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/tasks.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Notebook workflow (see requirements-notebooks.txt / ./run notebook).
# The notebooks themselves are generated from LESSON.md by
# tools/build_notebooks.py; these two are per-machine scratch state.
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.jupyter/

